* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Member:       NOMLOAD
* Function:     Get Natural Modules from Entire Connection to NOM FNAT
* Prerequisite: Define work files 7 and 8 as type 'PC'
* Parameters:   NOMLOAD LOAD     - LOAD Natural Objects from PC file
*                                  with replace
*               NOMLOAD          - No load, scan PC file only
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
IF *DATA > 0
  STACK TOP DATA '.'
  STACK TOP COMMAND 'SYSOBJH LOADALL WHERE REPL ALL PC'
ELSE
  STACK TOP DATA '.'
  STACK TOP COMMAND 'SYSOBJH SCANALL WHERE PC'
END-IF
STOP
END
